   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Light and shadow: median ~45, crushed blacks (p1 ~2), warm shadows (28,20,19), warm highlights (217,206,204), oranges 32% with aqua 20%, saturation 0.41. Small pools of warm light in darkness. Best for: Hard side-light, silhouettes, shafts of light in heritage corridors, minimal single-figure frames, dramatic doorway portraits. Very dark - hero frames.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
